// Title: <Detection title>
// ATT&CK: Txxxx.xxx | Tactic: <Tactic>
// Data source: DeviceProcessEvents (Microsoft Defender for Endpoint connector)
// Severity: Medium
// False positives: <benign causes>
// Suggested analytics rule: run every 15m, look back 30m, alert when results > 0.
// Entity mapping: Host = DeviceName, Account = AccountName, Process = ProcessCommandLine
// The time filter below is for ad-hoc hunting; the analytics rule's lookback applies when scheduled.
DeviceProcessEvents
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where FileName =~ "example.exe"
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "<value>"
| project TimeGenerated, DeviceName, AccountName, InitiatingProcessFileName, FileName, ProcessCommandLine
